+    `globalStatusScope` 100%, `checkFailed` 100%, `factsOf` 100%,
+    `Describe` 100%, `plannedRows` 100%, and `markerMoved` 100%.
+  - The profile preceded the new user-home test; that test separately exercises
+    the previously uncovered refusal branch in `globalStatusPlan`.
+
+## Repository gates
+
